--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ instance re-elaborated when completed: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
An instance created at a declaration-only point (incomplete argument
type) is cached and served stale after the type is completed and the
specialization is used ([temp.point]: the use is a new point of
instantiation).  The mem-initializer variant SEGFAULTS in
symex_assign.  Split from cpp17_incomplete_template_arg_decl.
